Usage: baseline config set TYPE VALUE...
       baseline start [--mode TYPE] [PATH...]
       baseline status [--format TYPE]
       baseline help [COMMAND...]
       baseline completion [SHELL] [ARG...]
       baseline --help
       baseline --version
       baseline --completion SHELL [[ARG...]]

  config set                
  start                     
  status                    
  help                        Show help information.
  completion                  Generate shell completion script or provide 
                              completions.
  --help                      Show help information.
  --version                   Show version information.
  --completion SHELL          Generate shell completion script.
  ARG                         Command line arguments for completion suggestions 
                              (used by shell integration; you usually don't 
                              need to provide this).

